  "translation": "Gomme mosadi yo morwa gagwe a phelago a bolela go kgoši, ka gobane mafele a gagwe a kgotsofetše go morwa gagwe; gomme a re: Ao, mong wa ka, mo fele ⟨את⟩ ngwana yo a phelago, gomme o se ke wa mo bolaya. Gomme yena ⟨yadi e nngwe⟩ a re: a se ke go ba ya nna goba ya wena — segang.",
